.TH EPIKSTREAMER 1 "October 2026" "EpikStreamer 2.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
epikstreamer \- playlist live streamer for EpikChat and RTMP services
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B epikstreamer
[\fB\-\-minimized\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
EpikStreamer streams a playlist of videos back to back over one RTMP connection using the system
.BR ffmpeg (1),
with overlays, background music, microphone (PulseAudio/PipeWire), scheduling, chat commands and song requests.
EpikChat sign\-in and the chat panel use WebKitGTK; stream keys are stored in the Secret Service keyring
(or an encrypted fallback file under ~/.config/epikstreamer when no keyring is available).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-minimized
Start minimized to the tray (used by "Launch at login").
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
~/.config/epikstreamer/, ~/.local/share/epikstreamer/
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/nano11b/EpikStreamer
